{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10131280","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10131280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1013128001:0":{"text":"여기가 메린 양의 집인가요? 여성의 집에 방문하는 것이니, 예의를 갖추어야...","source_cn":"梅瑞特小姐的家，就在这里吗？拜访女性的住所，看来我得保...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9C9CC8607DE3545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013128002:0":{"text":"누나가 낯선 남자를 데리고 왔어! 이런 일은 한 번도 없었는데, 설마...","source_cn":"姐姐带了陌生的男孩子回来了！从来没有这种事，难道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96F344A60E29D653","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013128003:0":{"text":"알았다! 저 사람은 언니가 붙잡았다가 다시 놓아줬던 그 갈색곰인데, 지금은 사람으로 변신해서 은혜를 갚으러 온 거야!","source_cn":"我知道了！他是被姐姐射中又放走的小棕熊，现在变成人形来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF40A71FBC1FDDD4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013128004:1":{"text":"...잠깐, 왜 갈색곰인 거죠? 더 멋진 동물은 없는 건가요?","source_cn":"……等等，为什么是小棕熊？没有更帅气的动物吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6CA242F5F20C9D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013128005:0":{"text":"이봐, 너희 둘. 손님들을 귀찮게 하면 안 돼. 할아버지, 할머니는?","source_cn":"喂！你们两个，别闹我的客人们。爷爷奶奶呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x130B9ABDCD4ED4D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013128006:0":{"text":"뒤쪽에 가로등이 고장 나서 할아버지가 고치러 갔어. 할머니는 할아버지 사다리를 붙잡아 주신다고...","source_cn":"之前后面的路灯坏掉了，爷爷去修灯了，奶奶给他扶梯子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AA4E2FD50826845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:弟弟拉维斯":{"text":"라비스","source":"弟弟拉维斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:妹妹安妮尔":{"text":"에니어","source":"妹妹安妮尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:梅瑞特":{"text":"메린","source":"梅瑞特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":4}}